   "pd10v103.asm emulated pass by pass (93.6 µs idle) with its own registers and cycle counts",
   "Real front and rear silkscreen (the rear converted from the 6-input CorelDRAW file)",
   "POD9 slave port, RS-422 console and the POD10-041 remote, byte by byte",
   "AES3 output at half-bit level, including the splice at a switch",
   "11-step operator tutorial with live goals",
   "“Audio 7” enables five receivers; F0 C0/C7 swapped against the manual"
